 padding-top: 0px\">1960</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">-1968<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年，</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">北京</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">师大女附中学生。</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1966</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">4</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">月加入中国共产党，为预备党员。<br />\r\n											<br />\r\n											<span style=\"paddin