 color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1966</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">8</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">月</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">20</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">日</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">《光明日报》发表署名</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">宋要武</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">的文章《</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; 