"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1972</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">-1975</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年在</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">长春地质学院</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">学习，毕业分配在</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">中国地质科学院</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">地质矿产研究所，任研究助理。</span><br />\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1978</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">-1980</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年，考入</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">中国科学院研究生院</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">读研究生。</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><br />\r\n											&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1980</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年赴美留学。</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1983</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年获得美国波士顿大学</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">地球化学专业</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">硕士学位。</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1989<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年获得</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">美国麻省理工学院</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">地球化学专业博士学位。</span><br />\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1989</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">-2003</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年在美国麻萨诸塞州环保局任环境分析官员。</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;<br />\r\n											&nbsp;<br />\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;2003<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年，原</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">北京</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">101</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">中学</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">68</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">届高中毕业生卡玛（美籍）在美国拍摄了文革纪录片《八九点钟的太阳》（未在中国正式上映）。宋接受采访，第一次公开声明，文革中她从未参与过打人、抄家、破四旧等暴力行动；《光明日报》署名宋要武的文章，事先没有征求她的意见。宋否认文章为本人撰写，也未授权记者代笔。</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><br />\r\n											&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">2007</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">9</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">月，北京师大附属实验中学（原师大女附中）</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">90</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">周年校庆，宋彬彬被评为&ldquo;知名校友&rdquo;。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;<br />\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1968</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">4</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">月，宋和母亲被押到沈阳软禁。</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1969</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年初春，宋逃出沈阳，来到内蒙古自治区锡林郭勒盟牧区，后参加插队。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1972</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年春，经当地牧民和大队公社推荐，宋被一所大学接收，后因谣传而被退回。经老乡及知青反映，负责锡林郭勒盟招生的老师顶着压力录取了宋，宋进入长春地质学院成为工农兵学员。<br />\r\n											<br />\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: 15pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1975</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年29岁，宋获长春地质学院学士学位，</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(17,23,238); font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1980</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(17,23,238); font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年34岁赴美国留学，</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(17,23,238); font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1983</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(17,23,238); font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年37岁获波士顿大学硕士，</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(17,23,238); font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">1989</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(17,23,238); font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年43岁获麻省理工学院地球和大气系地球化学博士。后来一直在美国生活。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: black; font-size: 8pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1966</span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">年8</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">月18</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">日</span></span><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">，毛泽东在天安门第一次接见红卫兵。宋向毛泽东献了红卫兵袖章。<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; color: rgb(17,23,238); padding-top: 0px\">毛泽东问她叫什么名字，答：宋彬彬。毛又问：&ldquo;是文质彬彬的彬吗？&rdquo;她说是。毛说：&ldquo;要武嘛&rdquo;。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											&nbsp;</p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 16px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 7pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 16px 宋体; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: Wingdings; color: black; font-size: 14pt; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 7pt \'Times New Roman\'; padding-top: 0px; font-stretch: normal\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: 宋体; font-size: 18px; padding-top: 0px\">&nbsp;</span></font></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\r\n										<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; text-indent: -21pt; margin: 0cm 0cm 0pt 42pt; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											&nbsp;</p>\r\n									</div>\r\n								</div>\r\n							</div>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</td>\r\n				</tr>\r\n			</tbody>\r\n		</table>\r\n		<div class=\"clear\" id=\"paperBottom\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 80px\">\r\n			&nbsp;</div>\r\n	</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"blog_footer\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; widows: 1; text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(255,255,255); text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font: 12px/19px punctuation, 微软雅黑, Tohoma; white-space: normal; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(68,68,68); word-spacing: 0px; padding-top: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\">\r\n	<div class=\"operate_toolbar\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n		<div class=\"mod_interactive\" style=\"padding-bottom: 5px; margin: 0px; min-height: 30px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; float: left; padding-top: 5px\">\r\n			<ul id=\"footerInteractive\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; pa