le=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; color: rgb(155,155,155); padding-top: 0px\">评论时间: 2013-01-28 23:41:26</span>\r\n									<div class=\"op\" id=\"op2\" style=\"position: absolute; padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; top: 0px; right: 10px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n										<p class=\"op_normal\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<a class=\"c_tx qzCommentOption\" href=\"javascript:;\" onclick=\"CommentManager.showCommentEditor(\'2\');return false;\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; word-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(38,112,154); word-break: break-all; text-decoration: none; padding-top: 0px\" title=\"回复该评论\">回复</a></p>\r\n									</div>\r\n								</div>\r\n								<div class=\"gift_pic\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 5px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n									<p style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n										&nbsp;</p>\r\n								</div>\r\n								<table style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; width: 765px; padding-right: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n									<tbody style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n										<tr style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n											<td style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-size: 14px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n												[转]http://tieba.baidu.com/p/20949281<br />\r\n												《云图》看完了，有影射中国的感觉。其中涉及到9.18日、复制人、星美451。张海柱明显是混中国的帅哥。周讯在里面扮演了一个牺牲者的角色。总体的感觉是这部片子名义上以轮回为主题，但却想告诉世人，你们活在一个大的阴谋当中，只有适当的牺牲才能换来大部分人的觉醒。从环境当中可看到，亚洲人基本上是服务的角色，且毫无人的活性感觉。相当于影片的复制人。</td>\r\n										</tr>\r\n									</tbody>\r\n								</table>\r\n							</div>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</li>\r\n				</ol>\r\n				<div class=\"page_wrap\" style=\"z-index: 10; position: relative; padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 15px\">\r\n					<div class=\"pagenav\" id=\"commentPageIndexArea\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; float: right; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n						<div class=\"mod_pagenav\" style=\"text-align: center; padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 8px; padding-right: 8px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n							<p class=\"mod_pagenav_main\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; display: inline; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n								<span class=\"mod_pagenav_disable \" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px 5px 0px 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">上一页</span></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><span class=\"mod_pagenav_count\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px 5px 0px 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span class=\"current\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px 5px 0px 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; font-weight: bold; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">1</span></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></span><span class=\"mod_pagenav_disable \" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px 5px 0px 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">下一页</span></span><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n							<p class=\"mod_pagenav_option\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; display: inline; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n								<span class=\"mod_pagenav_turn\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">转到<input class=\"textinput\" id=\"pageIndex_input2\" style=\"border-bottom: rgb(218,218,218) 1px solid; position: relative; text-align: center; border-left: rgb(218,218,218) 1px solid; padding-bottom: 0px; background-color: rgb(255,255,255); margin: 1px 3px; outline-style: none; outline-color: invert; padding-left: 0px; outline-width: medium; width: 32px; padding-right: 0px; font-family: punctuation, 微软雅黑, Tohoma; height: 11px; color: rgb(68,68,68); font-size: 12px; border-top: rgb(218,218,218) 1px solid; top: -1px; cursor: text; font-weight: normal; border-right: rgb(218,218,218) 1px solid; padding-top: 5px; left: 3px\" type=\"text\" value=\"1\" /><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>页<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><button class=\"bt_tx2\" onclick=\"QZBlog.Util.PageIndexManager.goDirectPage($(\'pageIndex_input2\').value.trim());\" style=\"border-bottom: rgb(109,124,140) 1px solid; position: relative; text-align: center; border-left: rgb(109,124,140) 1px solid; padding-bottom: 2px; line-height: 18px; background-color: rgb(123,140,158); margin: 0px 0px 0px 5px; padding-left: 0px; width: 48px; padding-right: 0px; display: inline-block; font-family: Tahoma; background-position: 0px 0px; height: 20px; color: rgb(255,255,255); font-size: 12px; overflow: hidden; border-top: rgb(109,124,140) 1px solid; cursor: pointer; font-weight: normal; border-right: rgb(109,124,140) 1px solid; padding-top: 0px\" type=\"submit\">确 定</button></span></p>\r\n						</div>\r\n					</div>\r\n				</div>\r\n			</div>\r\n		</div>\r\n	</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n', '0', '1', '1', '2016-09-28 09:30:32', null, '0');
INSERT INTO `entry` VALUES ('307', '76', '《勇士闯魔域2》[日剧] 2013-1-28 21:28 阅读(0)', '<p>\r\n	&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" id=\"blogContentTable\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 0px; widows: 1; text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(255,255,255); text-indent: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; border-spacing: 0px; width: 880px; padding-right: 0px; border-collapse: collapse; font: 12px/19px punctuation, 微软雅黑, Tohoma; white-space: normal; table-layout: fixed; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(68,68,68); word-spacing: 0px; padding-top: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\">\r\n	<tbody style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n		<tr style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n			<td style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; word-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 0px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n				<div id=\"blogContainer\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 16px; padding-right: 16px; height: 10544px; overflow: hidden; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n					<div align=\"center\" class=\"lp_title_type_3\" id=\"paperTitleArea\" style=\"background-image: url(/qzone/space_item/orig/9/81177_t5.gif); padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 35px 72px; padding-left: 0px; width: 690px; padding-right: 0px; background-repeat: no-repeat; background-position: 50% 50%; height: 70px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n						<span id=\"paperTitle\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(0,0,0); word-break: break-all; padding-top: 25px\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"微软雅黑\" style=\"font-size: 26px\">《勇士闯魔域2》[日剧]</font></span></div>\r\n					<div data-webp-ctx-e=\"1\" id=\"blogDetailDiv\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; min-height: 380px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; color: rgb(0,0,0); font-size: 14px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n						<div class=\"blog_details_20120222\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n							<div style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">\r\n								<img alt=\"图片\" data-=\"\" data-img-idx=\"0\" src=\"http://b252.photo.store.qq.com/psb?/V148TWI01v1rR9/AvJ.hopW173v.kv*juKmxVzwkvraIIPjemINqjySdP0!/b/dJ19QJZ*DAAA&amp;ek=1&amp;kp=1&amp;pt=0&amp;bo=IANhDAAAAAABAGk!&amp;t=5&amp;su=0162587393&amp;sce=0-12-12&amp;rf=2-9\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; width: 800px; padding-right: 0px; height: 3169px; vertical-align: top; border-top: 0px; border-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\" /><br />\r\n								<br />\r\n								<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">平淡无奇的搞笑 脸都笑酸了. . . . . .&nbsp;日本,这是个好地方&nbsp;. . . . . .&nbsp;<br />\r\n								<br />\r\n								<span style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\"><img alt=\"图片\" data-=\"\" data-img-idx=\"1\" src=\"http://b251.photo.store.qq.com/psb?/V148TWI01v1rR9/rUVdV*i2uFrnvmBoEgZe050Qr38GpMQ2RWhlEYrp664!/b/dHroqpWtFQAA&amp;ek=1&amp;kp=1&amp;pt=0&amp;bo=IAPCAQAAAAABAMc!&amp;t=5&amp;su=085696737&amp;sce=0-12-12&amp;rf=2-9\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; width: 800px; padding-right: 0px; height: 450px; vertical-align: top; border-top: 0px; border-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\" /><br />\r\n								<br />\r\n								<img alt=\"图片\" data-=\"\" data-img-idx=\"2\" src=\"http://b252.photo.store.qq.com/psb?/V148TWI01v1rR9/XTUARRJaQaz0UkKJNCufUqXtq2pbCwv*bhWvPpTDaps!/b/dJRVN5YRDgAA&amp;ek=1&amp;kp=1&amp;pt=0&amp;bo=IAPCAQAAAAABAMc!&amp;t=5&amp;su=0150150113&amp;sce=0-12-12&amp;rf=2-9\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px; border-left: 0px; padding-bott