rmal; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(68,68,68); word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\" />\r\n	<br style=\"widows: 1; text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(255,255,255); text-indent: 0px; font: 14px/22px punctuation, 微软雅黑, Tohoma; white-space: normal; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(68,68,68); word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\" />\r\n	<font color=\"#2e8b57\" style=\"widows: 1; text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(255,255,255); text-indent: 0px; font: 14px/22px punctuation, 微软雅黑, Tohoma; white-space: normal; letter-spacing: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\">2).<strong style=\"padding-bottom: 0px; margin: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; padding-top: 0px\">ShopNC</strong></font><br style=\"widows: 1; text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(255,255,255); text-indent: 0px; font: 14px/22px punctuation, 微软雅黑, Tohoma; white-space: normal; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(68,68,68); word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\" />\r\n	<br style=\"widows: 1; text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(255,255,255); text-indent: 0px; font: 14px/22px punctuation, 微软雅黑, Tohoma; white-space: normal; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(68,68,68); word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\" />\r\n	<span style=\"widows: 1; text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(255,255,255); text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important; font: 14px/22px punctuation, 微软雅黑, Tohoma; white-space: normal; float: none; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(68,68,68); word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px\">ShopNC网上商店系统，是网城创想科技有限责任公司开发的一套网店系统。目前有&ldquo;单用户版&rdquo;，&ldquo;综合型多用户版&rdquo;，&ldquo;聚合型多用户版&rdquo;。 本系统免费，您可免费下载、免费使用、免费升级，无使用时间与功能限制！</span><br style=\"widows: 1; text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(255,255,255); text-indent: 0px; font: 14px/22px punctuation, 微软雅黑, Tohoma; white-space: normal; letter-spacing: normal; color: rgb(68,68,68); word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stro